ind":"update","title":"Hotfix #8: Bug fixes and visual improvements 🐞","summary":"HELLO, DEBUILDERS!We’d like to treat you to a new major update for our game:The tutorial has been globally improved (markers, tutorial text, etc.). Now it will be much easier for you to figure out how to play the gameThe shaders and lighting in the game have been improvedThe bug that allowed you to press the lever without leaving the van has been fixedThe bug where the van door wouldn’t open if the player was loading for a long time has been fixedNow the animations (buttons 3-7) are visible from","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T11:23:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039400","verified_at":"2026-10-24T14:37:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5168980-1846651706696001","game_id":"steam-5168980","kind":"announcement","title":"Debuilders Live — Playing the Free Demo on Next Fest!","summary":"HELLO, DEBUILDERS!We're playing the free Debuilders demo live right on the store page — construction chaos and four defected builders in action. Come watch, ask questions, or better yet — grab the free demo and join the crew!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T16:47:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696001","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5168980-1846651706692614","game_id":"steam-5168980","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix #7: Bug fixes and visual polish 🐞","summary":"HELLO, DEBUILDERS! We're happy to bring you a new major update for the game: Updated and improved animations, including the twitch when rotating the characterFixed tool and item positions in character handsCompletely reworked the quota logicAdded animations for hotkeys 3, 4, 5, 6, 7Improved the tablet UI and removed the \"holy glow\" after a short circuitReworked fine amountsFixed a bug with the shower displayImproved ragdollGlobal visual overhaul of the menu and all its sections!Balance tweaksClo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T20:20:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692614","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5168980-1846651706692549","game_id":"steam-5168980","kind":"announcement","title":"Debuilders at Steam Next Fest — the demo is live!","summary":"HELLO, DEBUILDERS! 🚧Starting today, Debuilders is part of Steam Next Fest - a perfect excuse to come check out our construction site!WHAT'S THE GAME?A co-op comedy builder for up to 4 players, where every crew member has their own \"defect\": the foreman (Deadline) is the only one who can see the work plan, the strongman (Squint) smashes through walls but can barely see a thing, the painter (Easel) is colorblind, and the fourth guy (Melatony) just keeps falling asleep on his feet. The goal - finis","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T20:03:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692549","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5168980-1846651706675330","game_id":"steam-5168980","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix #6: Bug fixes 🐞","summary":"HELLO, DEBUILDERS! We’re back with a new batch of improvements: Physics has been fixed and now works correctly! ✅✅✅Balance changes! New quota logic, characters are slower, and tasks now take longer to complete ✅ New animations have been added ✅The interface font has been updated ✅Cosmetic improvements (several new models have been added to the house to make it cozier, and the walls have been repainted) ✅We are actively continuing to put in the effort for you, and I can confidently say that playi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T18:49:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675330","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5168980-1846018067941923","game_id":"steam-5168980","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix #5: Bug fixes 🐞","summary":"HELLO, DEBUILDERS!Today, a lot of work was done on the animations. Now playing will be much more enjoyable!In the near future, there will be more updates to the animations and physics. Very soon, the demo will be presented in its full form. Stay tuned!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T18:05:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941923","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5168980-1846018067938209","game_id":"steam-5168980","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix #4: Bug fixes 🐞","summary":"HELLO, DEBUILDERS!We’ve prepared a new batch of improvements and fixes for you:The cylinders in the lobby are now working as they should ✅The shaking of the vase has been fixed ✅A hint has been added to the tablet on the second quota for Molbert’s task (we know it was hard to figure out the task before. Now it will definitely be easier) ✅In the coming days, you’ll also see major improvements to the animations and physics. We’ll be in touch!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T10:50:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938209","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5168980-1846018067934927","game_id":"steam-5168980","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix #3: Bug fixes 🐞","summary":"HELLO, DEBUILDERS!We’ve done a lot of work today to fix bugs and improve features, and you can already download the update!What has been fixed and added:When the quota time runs out, the van leaves without you! — implemented ✅The stream from the tap in the bathroom looks nicer — implemented ✅Shower room details are destroyed with normal logic - implemented ✅The vase is normally in your hands - implemented ✅Melatoni's sound was redesigned before the launch of debuffs - implemented ✅ (previously i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T23:26:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934927","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5168980-1846018067932997","game_id":"steam-5168980","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix #2: Bug fixes 🐞","summary":"HELLO, DEBUILDERS!Arthur and I were relentlessly fueled by coffee and stayed up until late at night, fixing bugs that shouldn’t have made it into the demo but somehow managed to get thereWhat was fixed:Sometimes, when a player was painting a wall, it would look painted only to them, and the task wouldn’t be counted — fixed ✅The roller could paint through the wall or floor, including cans of paint — fixed ✅The shower room destruction mechanics have been improved. Previously, the part would simply","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T11:29:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932997","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5168980-1846018067930531","game_id":"steam-5168980","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix #1: Bug fixes🐞","summary":"Hello, debuilders!We noticed one critical bug that killed the opportunity to pass the second quota (it was impossible to pick up the pipe wrench). We urgently got behind the fix and now everything is working as it should!We hope that now you will be able to fully enjoy our demo. Have a nice game!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T16:52:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930531","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5168980-1846018067929435","game_id":"steam-5168980","kind":"announcement","title":"🚧 The construction site is open! The DEBUILDERS demo is available right now!","summary":"Hi, debuilders!This day has come. The engine of our van is running, the sledgehammers have been handed out, and the trainees are already neatly packed into their cardboard boxes. You can download the DEBUILDERS demo and start destroying someone’s house with your friends right now!But let’s be honest. Our game is all about physics, chaos, and unpredictability. And sometimes this chaos goes beyond our blueprintsYes, the demo has bugs, rough edges, and moments when gravity suddenly takes an unpaid ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T12:13:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929435","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5168980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:07:42Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:07:42Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5168980":"2026-10-26T09:07:42Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5168980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:07:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10